# spec-mirror/ holds byte-for-byte copies of documents whose originals live in the Shipyard
# data dir, and runcoach-api/tests/test_normative_mirror.py compares the two by bytes (T124).
# The originals are not uniform in line endings (one is CRLF, one mixed), so any normalisation
# on add or conversion on checkout would make every checkout differ from the original by
# platform and fail the gate. `-text` stores and checks out the copies verbatim everywhere.
spec-mirror/** -text
